FILE: ChangeLog.md
FEATURE: modal-slide-effect
DATE: 2026-10-08
PRIOR STATE: as left by feature 'modal-scroll-lock' and later teardown work

================================================================================
CHANGE 1 — v4.0.0-beta Added
================================================================================

OLD_SECTION
(last Added bullet: Runnable core utilities example ...)

NEW_SECTION
- ModalDisplayer "slide" effect — the modal slides down from above the viewport into place and slides back up on close; set `config.effect = "slide"`

REASON
Release-facing record of the new effect.

================================================================================
CHANGE 2 — v4.0.0-beta Added
================================================================================

OLD_SECTION
(after the "slide" bullet)

NEW_SECTION
- ModalDisplayer "slideLeft" and "slideRight" effects — the modal slides in sideways and stays docked to an edge as a full height panel instead of centring: slideLeft enters from the right and docks right, slideRight enters from the left and docks left

REASON
Release-facing record.

================================================================================
CHANGE 3 — rename in the unreleased bullet
================================================================================

OLD_SECTION
- ModalDisplayer "slide" effect — the modal slides down from above the viewport into place and slides back up on close; set `config.effect = "slide"`

NEW_SECTION
- ModalDisplayer "drop" effect — the modal drops from above the viewport into place and rises back up on close; set `config.effect = "drop"`

REASON
Edited in place rather than appended: the bullet was added in this same unreleased change, so a "slide" effect never shipped and a second bullet would describe an effect that does not exist.

================================================================================
CHANGE 4 — exit direction in the unreleased bullet
================================================================================

OLD_SECTION
slideLeft enters from the right and docks right, slideRight enters from the left and docks left

NEW_SECTION
slideLeft enters from the right, docks right and leaves by continuing left off the screen; slideRight mirrors it

REASON
Edited in place; same unreleased change.

================================================================================
CHANGE 5 — exit direction in the unreleased bullet
================================================================================

OLD_SECTION
slideLeft enters from the right, docks right and leaves by continuing left off the screen; slideRight mirrors it

NEW_SECTION
slideLeft enters from the right, docks right and leaves back out to the right; slideRight mirrors it on the left

REASON
Edited in place; same unreleased change.

